    <table>
        <tr th:each="customer : ${customers}">
            <td th:text="${customer.name}"></td>
            <td th:text="${customer.email}"></td>
            <td>
                <a href="/updateCustomer/${customer.id}">Update</a>
                <a href="/deleteCustomer/${customer.id}">Delete</a>
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>
</body>
</html>
```

2. **Customer Form**: Create a `addCustomer.jsp` file for adding new customers.

```jsp
